    "note": "Enrolled version (82nd Session, 2023), the text both houses passed (final votes on the 1st and 2nd Reprints). Sections 2 and 3 were deleted by amendment. Section 5 (NRS 202.253) adds a cross-reference to section 4 and strikes a colon. Sections 9.1-9.3 (school emergency plans and school police training) and section 11 (suicide-prevention website posting and pamphlet on negligent storage) are not quoted."
